PACKAGE NAME:     ntb-xfig
PACKAGE SIZE:     244 K
PACKAGE LOCATION: diskt6
PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
ntb-xfig: ntb-xfig 1.1
ntb-xfig:
ntb-xfig: This package contains the binaries for xfig, an interactive drawing
ntb-xfig: tool under X. xfig can create fig, epsf and LaTeX files with various
ntb-xfig: options.  You also have to install ntb-traf so that xfig can export
ntb-xfig: fig files as epsf and LaTeX files. This package also contains a set
ntb-xfig: of basic examples of fig files (see /usr/lib/texmf/xfig/examples).
